{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1127998-nunehi-raiding-and-the-garou","id":1127998,"title":"Nunehi Raiding and the Garou.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-12T03:48:44-07:00","id":1127998,"title":"Nunehi Raiding and the Garou.","content":"is their a way to explain A Nunehi recharging his Glamour through Raiding not simply being ripped apart the first time the effects he has on the land are noticed by a garou?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T08:17:42-07:00","id":1128051,"title":"","content":"Yes. The WoD is not actually unified into one setting, and the Garou are not exactly swarming the hills with their numbers.<br /> <br /> (Ratkin are swarming under the cities with their numbers, though...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T08:26:05-07:00","id":1128055,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1127998-nunehi-raiding-and-the-garou#post1127998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">is their a way to explain A Nunehi recharging his Glamour through Raiding not simply being ripped apart the first time the effects he has on the land are noticed by a garou?</div> </div> </div> </div>Same reason illegal dumping happens and Garou don't show up and murder every human being who tries that? There's only so many Garou and the majority are sitting around waiting for Vampires to go into the woods to murder them to maintain the sense of &quot;the cage&quot; that is important for Vampire genre. They don't have time to be doing both W:TA stuff and V:TM genre conceits. I mean plus they are killing random Sidhe .. so much work.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T09:28:12-07:00","id":1128072,"title":"","content":"The Mists affect the Garou as much as anyone else making it difficult to find the culprit. And like said Garou numbers are extremely limited. I cant recall the exact numbers involved but the general idea is that one should map how many Garou are needed to fullfill all the needed positions at caern and then halve that number to get some idea how few they actually are.<br /> <br /> Sure if Garou managed to get the culprit redhanded he could rip it apart before the Mists cloud his mind but all Fae, nunnehi included, are rather slippery after the fact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T13:06:43-07:00","id":1128140,"title":"","content":"I mean don't the Nunnehi kind of dislike other Nunnehi for Raiding the lands? Seems like a really douchy short sighted thing that a Winter Camp would do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T19:23:40-07:00","id":1128306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Possessed</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1127998-nunehi-raiding-and-the-garou?p=1128072#post1128072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Mists affect the Garou as much as anyone else making it difficult to find the culprit. And like said Garou numbers are extremely limited. I cant recall the exact numbers involved but the general idea is that one should map how many Garou are needed to fullfill all the needed positions at caern and then halve that number to get some idea how few they actually are.<br /> <br /> Sure if Garou managed to get the culprit redhanded he could rip it apart before the Mists cloud his mind but all Fae, nunnehi included, are rather slippery after the fact.</div> </div> </div> </div>On the other hand, a young Wendigo with Beat of the Heart Drum could probably manage it, if in the right place and time. After that, they might consider repeat performances a terribly bad idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}